From 6fab10facc3785be0d677553cfd6f90e539890e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:00:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] test-posix: Check getpwnam, getpwuid and their
 reentrant forms

errno is left alone when nothing matches, ERANGE comes only from a
buffer too small for the entry found, the strings lie in the buffer,
sysconf(_SC_GETPW_R_SIZE_MAX) answers, and EMFILE is reported.
---
 test/test-posix/test-pwd/CMakeLists.txt    |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-pwd/meson.build       |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-pwd/test-getpwnam.c   | 189 +++++++++++++++++++++
 test/test-posix/test-pwd/test-getpwnam_r.c |  66 ++++++-
 test/test-posix/test-pwd/test-getpwuid_r.c |  71 +++++++-
 5 files changed, 316 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 test/test-posix/test-pwd/test-getpwnam.c

